<title>USA: Schawk Inc Q4 net loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Schawk Inc Q4 net loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>DES PLAINES, Ill. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr profit	  $0.05   profit	 $0.09</p>
<p> Net shr loss		1.58   profit	  0.11</p>
<p> Net loss		  31,004   profit	 2,381</p>
<p> Sales		     26,882		   20,290</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  19,789		   19,176</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr profit	  $0.22   profit	 $0.26</p>
<p> Net shr loss		1.34   profit	  0.29</p>
<p> Net loss		  24,984   profit	 6,936</p>
<p> Sales		     90,763		   87,204</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  19,545		   19,203</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Net Q4 1996 includes a charge of $33 million, or $1.67 per share, related to the sale of the company's plastics group, and a charge of $630,000, or $0.03 per share, related to technology obsolescence.</p>
<p>Q4 1995 includes a gain of $544,000, or $0.03 per share, related to a tax benefit for net operating loss carryforwards.</p>
<p>1996 oper shr results do not include results from the company's plastics group, which was sold on February 7, 1997.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
